  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resultatsammanst&#xe4;llning Ukraina. I samband med framtagande av f&#xf6;rslag till landsstrategi f&#xf6;r Ukraina skall en resultatssammanst&#xe4;llning utarbetas. Konsult Lisa Roman skall anlitas f&#xf6;r uppdraget som ber&#xe4;knas omfatta 4 arbetsdagar a 4 000 SEK, dvs totalt 16 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Synthesis of results, Ukraine. In accordance with the development of a proposal for the Country Strategy for Ukraine, a synthesis of the projectresults will be carried out by the consultant Lisa Roman. The work is estimated to take four days, to a cost of 4 000 SEK/day (ie 16 000 SEK).</narrative>
